WEBVTT

00:30:56.063 --> 00:31:01.930
in terms of that sacred relationship
between government

00:31:01.963 --> 00:31:03.997
and the people who are governed.

00:31:04.497 --> 00:31:06.663
It's not just an American phenomenon.

00:31:06.697 --> 00:31:08.197
You see it in Europe.

00:31:08.230 --> 00:31:12.097
You see it in alternative movements
in various countries.

00:31:12.663 --> 00:31:16.197
And I think it is the great task
of our generation

00:31:16.230 --> 00:31:18.197
not only to deal with climate,

00:31:18.197 --> 00:31:21.697
but to restore a sense of fairness

00:31:21.730 --> 00:31:25.930
to our economies, to our societies,

00:31:25.963 --> 00:31:27.397
to our world.

00:31:27.430 --> 00:31:30.997
And that is part of this battle, I think.